 to use `importlib.resources`. This allows the CLI to find its required files regardless of where it is installed.\n2.  **Workspace Logging**: Redirected all logs and temporary audit files to `.boomtick/logs/` in the current working directory, ensuring the package directory remains read-only after installation.\n3.  **MCP Decoupling**: Updated the MCP server to call the global `td-cli` command. Removed hardcoded relative paths and `PYTHONPATH` mutations in favor of standard module resolution and system-wide binary access.\n4.  **Editable Install Support**: Verified the changes by installing the CLI in editable mode and running it from external directories.\n5.  **Test Maintenance**: Updated unit tests that relied on hardcoded paths to use the new resource resolution logic.\n\nNote: One MCP test (`github.create_issue.test.ts`) failed due to a missing `contract.ts` file in the source tree, which appears to be a pre-existing issue unrelated to the packaging changes. All 77 Python CLI tests passed successfully.\n\nFixes #3476\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task [15140313879804418135](https://jules.google.com/task/15140313879804418135) started by @arii*", "created_at": "2026-07-09T22:31:20Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-10T02:39:12Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "a9187997a4e1968f29890f0d5df23e49b9fdb5ed", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 11321023849, "node_id": "LA_kwDOSD1fmM8AAAACoskdaQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arii/tech-dancer/labels/approved%20with%20suggestions", "name": "approved with suggestions", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": null}], "milestone": null, "draft": true, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arii/tech-dancer/pulls/3485/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arii/tech-dancer/pulls/3485/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arii/tech-dancer/pulls/comments{/number}", "comm